", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/083987e0/uploads/origins/6f157270-7506-4332-a7ba-4b42bd173bc9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c44f625416182a201fe4b662d4cbb047, https://si.imgix.net/083987e0/uploads/origins/6f157270-7506-4332-a7ba-4b42bd173bc9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8730d3b1ed9816dfc9c8fd1a5294d8a8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/083987e0/uploads/origins/6f157270-7506-4332-a7ba-4b42bd173bc9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7f8c26a017c6dc639b7fb84b5780cafe 3x"}, "body": "Thank you for the appeal!  I am glad you see the parts of my character that I like about her, and am curious to see what you have in mind for rendering her!\n\nHer personality is generally cute and friendly and a little silly, though she also has a dangerous combat side to her that usually remains hidden.  You can feel free to lean into either aspect or a combination.\n\nShe should always have cybernetic arms and legs and she usually has 4 extra ones mounted on her back, but she changes her limbs out so any design or style of her limbs works if you feel like playing with your own cybernetic designs.\n\nFor clothes, she likes to look cute and fashionable and stylish, since she is trying to be an influencer.  There are several outfits she is already drawn with, but I always welcome new attempts at fashion.  Her favorite color is green and she tends to enjoy wearing hats or having a headband.\n\nShe always has an eyepatch over her right eye, though she owns many of them in different designs.  Her left eye is green and has a beauty mark under it.  She has a little bit of freckles on her face.\n\nShe often carries around sugary snacks or her phone though you can feel free to omit those details.  \n\nI like the way you draw traditionally cute anime girls and would love to see Callie in that sort of style, so looking forward to seeing what happens!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1qmKqVYLF5DYKWsh_CKiHOsRW2zgkAhgP", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@amawaaa/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 491535, "client_id": 2196378, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a3a9c842/uploads/origins/d679419c-33b3-4746-8851-96ff468a5307?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c20922a3b30401ec4fd2b0c94c68fae2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a3a9c842/uploads/origins/d679419c-33b3-4746-8851-96ff468a5307?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c20922a3b30401ec4fd2b0c94c68fae2, https://si.imgix.net/a3a9c842/uploads/origins/d679419c-33b3-4746-8851-96ff468a5307?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c33c63c415082ec44d6df1db2f3c5011 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a3a9c842/uploads/origins/d679419c-33b3-4746-8851-96ff468a5307?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ba3dad605db121282428497c3272c46 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a3a9c842/uploads/origins/d679419c-33b3-4746-8851-96ff468a5307?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fc6773c86190cd64e5c1efa5e9def598", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a3a9c842/uploads/origins/d679419c-33b3-4746-8851-96ff468a5307?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fc6773c86190cd64e5c1efa5e9def598, https://si.imgix.net/a3a9c842/uploads/origins/d679419c-33b3-4746-8851-96ff468a5307?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ca3c2ab60befd843160792bfa2e3c841 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a3a9c842/uploads/origins/d679419c-33b3-4746-8851-96ff468a5307?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompre