1d883055dd 3x"}, "body": "Hello 奄環和弘さん! \n\nThank you so much for your appeal, I would absolutely love if you could draw Magellan for me!! \n\nShe's a calm and level-headed kind of character with a lot of curiosity, with her self-stated mission to explore worlds and places that both humans and machines haven't yet visited. In terms of pose and composition, I trust you to make something that you enjoy! 🙇‍♂️\n\nThank you again for your consideration!!\n\nReferences: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_KaEeLK3LZEO3tJPp8LyylwYiA6A7eWL?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@amawaaa/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 491535, "client_id": 3406975, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b9bfc786/uploads/origins/3339cf37-0197-40e6-8a14-ee03b4a31b6e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a46f994a7140fd21a69c88b4c1458d2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b9bfc786/uploads/origins/3339cf37-0197-40e6-8a14-ee03b4a31b6e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a46f994a7140fd21a69c88b4c1458d2, https://si.imgix.net/b9bfc786/uploads/origins/3339cf37-0197-40e6-8a14-ee03b4a31b6e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a04a840f63f9cb1447efd774eed961cd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b9bfc786/uploads/origins/3339cf37-0197-40e6-8a14-ee03b4a31b6e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2df7b0113a05128eae60fabc619534e0 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b9bfc786/uploads/origins/3339cf37-0197-40e6-8a14-ee03b4a31b6e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8d590aae5e1459213b530f4b67e5b67f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b9bfc786/uploads/origi