clude the PSD, if you can! \nPlease make sure the edges of her head and body aren't cut off in the image so everything is visible!\n\nI would like to use the art for promotional material: such as twitter, youtube, kickstarter materials/rewards, and Steam. \nAnd included in an art book with concept pieces that comes with the game!\n\nHere's the reference materials for Isadora!\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1eEg2ZL3jz0JSRVTPEech8audq2U8oL4k?usp=drive_link\n\nThank you!", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1143777, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "かぼ", "screen_name": "kabohell", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1494453391820353546/o2f2w50j.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1046794659370946561/1699199593/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 144}, {"id": 1605284, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "やぬ氏", "screen_name": "9adola", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1475650495775932416/vnNplYNT.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1403348911394152448/1645554009/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 14, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 1}, {"id": 2116055, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "てぉ", "screen_name": "Teo_illust", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_i